{"slug":"Universal-Script-Discord-Invitation-Prompt-Module-1503","_id":"6240d315d5125114954509f8","title":"Discord Invitation Prompt Module","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c77d0f","gameId":0,"name":"Universal Script 📌","imageUrl":"/images/sb/1397032-1648415562126.jpg","placeId":0},"features":"This module allows you to create Discord-style invitation prompts for your users to interact with.\nThey can choose to either accept or deny the invitation. However, this prompt is entirely optional, as you can use the Join function to skip this process and make the user instantaneously join the linked Discord server.\n\nNotes:\n    - An invitation will always be prompted on the user's Discord client, this is \n       unavoidable.","tags":["Discord","Join","Auto","Invite","Vynixu"],"script":"Module : https://raw.githubusercontent.com/RegularVynixu/Utilities/main/Discord%20Inviter/Source.lua\nDocumentation : https://raw.githubusercontent.com/RegularVynixu/Utilities/main/Discord%20Inviter/Documentation.lua\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nExample:\n\nlocal Module = loadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/RegularVynixu/Utilities/main/Discord%20Inviter/Source.lua\"))()\n\nModule.Prompt({\n    invite = \"your invite here\", -- required\n    name = \"custom server name here\" -- optional\n})","owner":{"_id":"622b0cb171002d054a2de105","username":"Vynixu","verified":true,"profilePicture":"/images/photo/622b0cb171002d054a2de105-1766397214454.png","status":"offline","id":"622b0cb171002d054a2de105","leaderboard":{"tag":null},"topMilestone":{"key":"creator.likes","tier":100}},"verified":true,"views":35855,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":true,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","createdAt":"2022-03-27T21:11:49.761Z","dislikeCount":0,"likeCount":9,"image":"/images/sb/1397032-1648415562126.jpg","executes":39,"keyless":false,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"changelog":[{"_id":"67e5e1e2b360710ec3c4b168","editBy":